OL,3,CUK faces fourth heatwave, with more to
OL,4,Ccome
OL,6,FA fourth heatwave is expected to hit
OL,7,Fthe UK next week, as wildfires tear
OL,8,Fthrough parts of the country.
OL,10,FAlthough cooler and fresher weather is
OL,11,Fexpected widely on Sunday, the heat
OL,12,Fwill climb again at start of the week,
OL,13,Fwith Monday's high forecast at 27C in
OL,14,Fthe south east, just below the area's
OL,15,Fheatwave threshold of 28C.
OL,17,FHeatwave thresholds will start to be
OL,18,Ftopped the following day, with highs
OL,19,Fof more than 30C expected until
OL,20,FThursday in the south east.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
