OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785057499
OL,3,CUK faces fourth heatwave, with more to
OL,4,Ccome
OL,6,FNext week's heatwave may not be the
OL,7,Flast of the summer, the Met Office's
OL,8,Flong range forecast suggests.
OL,10,F"(The weather) is a bit more
OL,11,Fchangeable in the short term, but as
OL,12,Fwe head more into August there are
OL,13,Fhints that conditions will settle down
OL,14,Fand become drier again," said Met
OL,15,FOffice senior operational
OL,16,Fmeteorologist Marco Petagna.
OL,26,@rD@AOU
