PN,31403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785057499
OL,3,CUK faces fourth heatwave, with more to
OL,4,Ccome
OL,6,FIt comes as a blaze swept through the
OL,7,FCairngorms National Park, in what
OL,8,FPolice Scotland declared as a major
OL,9,Fincident, and emergency crews
OL,10,Fcontinued to tackle wildfires in Wales.
OL,12,FNorth Wales and the Upper Severn
OL,13,Fbecame the first part of the UK to
OL,14,Fdeclare drought status on Thursday,
OL,15,Fand parts of Exeter, Devon and Usk in
OL,16,FWales met their heatwave thresholds
OL,17,Ffor 20 consecutive days.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
