OL,3,CUK faces fourth heatwave, with more to
OL,4,Ccome
OL,6,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FNo rain has fallen in July in
OL,12,FBedfordshire, Buckinghamshire,
OL,13,FHertfordshire and West Sussex, and 16
OL,14,Fcounties have recorded 0.1mm, which
OL,15,F"might just be a bit of dew on the
OL,16,Fgrass", according to Petagna.
OL,18,FThe UK has had 20% of its average July
OL,19,Frainfall, which takes into account the
OL,20,Fwetter areas.
OL,26,@wD@AOUxD@FO]
