PN,31405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785057499
OL,3,CUK faces fourth heatwave, with more to
OL,4,Ccome
OL,6,FIt is "very, very unusual" for a hot
OL,7,Fand dry spell to last this long,
OL,8,FPetagna added.
OL,10,FThe dry conditions follow last year's
OL,11,Fdrought summer, as the UK faces more
OL,12,Fextreme weather which is being blamed
OL,13,Fon human-caused climate change, mostly
OL,14,Ffrom burning fossil fuels.
OL,16,FHeat alerts are in place across parts
OL,17,Fof England with officials warning that
OL,18,Ftemperatures are likely to impact on
OL,19,Fhealth and wellbeing.
OL,26,@nD@GOUnD@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
