PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785057499
OL,3,CUK faces fourth heatwave, with more to
OL,4,Ccome
OL,6,FYellow alerts for the East Midlands,
OL,7,FEast of England, London, South East,
OL,8,FSouth West and West Midlands are in
OL,9,Fplace until 9am on Sunday.
OL,11,FWildfires continue to burn across the
OL,12,FRhinogydd mountains, North Wales, and
OL,13,FBlaenavon, South Wales, with the
OL,14,Flatter affecting 220 hectares.
OL,16,FThe past days have also seen blazes on
OL,17,Fhealthland on the Isle of Wight,
OL,18,Fwoodland in the New Forest and fields
OL,19,Fin Tadley, Hampshire.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
