OL,3,CUK faces fourth heatwave, with more to
OL,4,Ccome
OL,6,FMassive forest fires have forced the
OL,7,Fevacuation of more than 250,000 people
OL,8,Fin south-western France and central
OL,9,FSpain as flames raged out of control.
OL,11,FThe virulence of the wildfires, fueled
OL,12,Fby high temperatures and the long-term
OL,13,Feffects of climate change, caught fire
OL,14,Fcrews and authorities off guard in
OL,15,Fboth countries.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
